ttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121908","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121908.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121908.patch","merged_at":"2026-07-30T16:13:59Z"},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nFixes a regression from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/116490\r\nShader editor document list error icon was not being updated immediately on validation, I forgot to remove the if statement so the signal connects for shaders too.\r\n<img width=\"202\" height=\"25\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/22e035a9-7eb0-43b1-bef2-b03e0dfe3881\" />\r\n\r\nAlso updated the signal and function name.\r\n\r\n- Fixes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/37783\r\n\r\nThe SignalsDock tree was updating when any script validation updated, not just the one in cares about.\r\nIt was not updating when script attached/detached.\r\nIt was not updating when external editor changed the signals.\r\n(These weren't part of the regression, I just happened to fix them when trying to find a better place for the Signals update from ScriptEditor).\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nCopied the signal connection logic from EditorInspector, not sure if this needs the `get_validated_object`, but I figured its safer to have it.\r\n\r\nThere is still one use of `SignalsDock::update_lists()` in C# code so I didn't remove it. Not sure if it is still needed or not since IDK why it was updating for the inspector too.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121908/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121908/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}